# Keep the build context small and reproducible. Dependencies install fresh
# in the image; nothing local should leak in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.docusaurus
**/build
# Terraform providers are hundreds of megabytes after `terraform init`, and
# state can contain secrets. Neither belongs in any application image context.
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
.claude
.git
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
scratchpad
